==Battleground==
*2 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*3 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*2 [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 146.67 seconds<sup>4,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[THE FOLIVOREAN]] spawns as the boss.
**9 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
**5 [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**Infinite [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn, delay 43.33~50 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
By now you should definitely have [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], who will destroy this stage. While the J.J. Jackrabbits may seem threatening, as long as you meatshield in tandem with Courier, you should have no problem destroying this stage. If you are having trouble, be sure to upgrade Courier as high as you can.

